# Backend Python

## Workspace

Packages under `backend/packages/` (core, parsers, indexer, adapters, ai, security). Apps under `backend/apps/api`, `apps/cli`, `apps/mcp`. Dev tools in `backend/pyproject.toml`: Ruff lint+format (120 cols), mypy strict on `ci_core` + `ci_parsers` only (`db.py` excluded).

## Routers stay thin

`backend/apps/api` delegates to `ci_core`, `ci_indexer`, `ci_ai`. No framework-specific logic in core.

## Extending

- Analyzers: entry point group `codebase_intelligence.analyzers` (see `ci_indexer.analyzers`).
- Views: `register_view` in `ci_core.views` or entry point `codebase_intelligence.views`.
- Bump `ADAPTER_VERSION` when edge/node semantics change.

## GraphIndex

Loaded via `GraphStore.load_index()` with mtime cache (`ci_core.db`). Analytics in `ci_core.insights` and `graph_algo` only on loaded index — do not re-parse source in views.

## Tests

Pytest roots: `backend/packages`, `backend/apps`. Match package under test. Prefer config ignores over inline `noqa`.
